{title: 285 - Jesus Calls Us}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #285 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 285}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls us o'er the [Ab]tumult of [Db]ourlife's [Cm]wild, [Fm]restless [Bbm]sea;
[Eb7]Day by day [Ab]his sweet voice soundeth, [Db/F]saying, "Christian, [Eb7]follow [Ab]me!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls [Ab]us from [Db]the [Cm]worship
[Ab]of [Eb7]the vain [Ab/C]world's [Db]golden [Fm]store,
[Eb7]from each [Ab]idol that [Db/F]would [Eb7]keep us,
[Eb7]saying, "Christian, [Ab]love [Db/F]me [Eb7]more!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]In [Eb7]our joys [Ab]and in [Db]our [Cm]sorrows,
[Ab]days [Eb7]of toil [Ab/C]and [Db]hours of [Fm]ease,
[Eb7]still he [Ab]calls, in cares [Db/F]and pleasures,
[Eb7]"Christian, [Ab]love me [Db/F]more than [Eb7]these!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls [Ab]us! By [Db]thy [Cm]mercies,
[Ab]Savior, [Eb7]may [Ab/C]we [Db]hear thy [Fm]call,
[Eb7]give our [Ab]hearts to thine [Db/F]obedience,
[Eb7]serve and [Ab]love thee [Db/F]best of [Eb7]all.
{end_of_verse}
